            The best espresso machine for most homes is the <strong class="text-white">Breville Barista Express</strong>, because its built-in burr grinder solves the biggest problem in home espresso in one footprint. Beginners focused on milk drinks should pair the <strong class="text-white">Bambino Plus</strong> with a good grinder, and households making several lattes every morning will appreciate the <strong class="text-white">Rancilio Silvia Pro X</strong>.
          </p>
